# GreenPulse API — env documentation
#
# ⚠️ This app does NOT need its own .env file.
# All runtime config comes from the ROOT monorepo file:
#   @ezstart/.env.local / .env.staging / .env.production
#
# See /SECRETS.md for the canonical architecture.
#
# Variables consumed by this API (from root):
#   - MONGO_URL                  → used via getMongoUrl('green-pulse')
#   - JWT_SECRET                 → used via getJwtSecret()
#   - GEMINI_API_KEY / OPENAI_API_KEY / ANTHROPIC_API_KEY → AI providers
#   - ESG_CLIENT_ID / ESG_CLIENT_SECRET / ESG_BASE_URL → ESG SaaS provider
#   - WEBHOOK_SIGNING_SECRET     → HMAC validation for incoming webhooks
#   - MAX_FILE_SIZE / UPLOAD_DIR → file uploads
#   - CORS_ORIGIN                → web origin allow-list
#   - LOG_LEVEL                  → pino log verbosity
#   - SENTRY_DSN_GREEN_PULSE     → resolved via getSentryDsn('green-pulse')
